@startuml
title Injection & Collection Sequence
actor User
participant Orchestrator
participant Injector
participant "Target System" as Target
participant Collector
database DB

User -> Orchestrator : CreateJob(payload, schedule)
Orchestrator -> DB : INSERT job
Orchestrator -> Broker : publish job message
Broker -> Injector : deliver job
Injector -> Target : POST payload
Target --> Injector : 200 / response
Injector -> Collector : emit result (push) or expect Collector to poll
Collector -> DB : INSERT result
Collector -> S3 : PUT large payload (optional)
Orchestrator -> DB : update job status (success/failure)
@enduml